  vendorName: Appraiser Carmichael
  offerText: I will pay top dollar for that hideous armchair. It clears your floor
    completely and fills your wallet with cash.
  acceptResultText: He pays you and his men take the chair. However, they spend the
    entire time aggressively mocking your poverty and living conditions, leaving
    your self-esteem in absolute ruins.
  rejectResultText: You keep the ugly chair. It may not be fancy, but it is yours,
    and you feel proud of it.
